              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakube kuhle kuwe ukubusisa indlu yenceku yakho ukuze ibe phambi kobuso bakho kuze kube nininini; ngoba uyabusisa, Jehova, njalo lizabusiswa kuze kube nininini.",
          "type": "text",
